  "title": "JAMANVAAR Admin — Restaurant Operations & Intelligence",
  "text": "QA Kiosk Only Merged Admin 1791270507575\nADMIN\nQA Kiosk Only Merged Admin 1791270507575\nCtrl+K\nNo open shift\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLogout\nOPERATIONS\nDashboard\nDIGITAL ORDERING\nQR Table Ordering\nLOCKED\nPEOPLE & CASH\nOffers & Coupons\nKIOSK\nKiosk Terminals\nANALYTICS & SYSTEM\nReports & Analytics\nPrinters & Devices\nReceipt & E-Bill\nSync & Devices\nRestaurant Settings\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nTerminal screen size\n\nThe size POS, KDS, Captain and Kiosk screens open at. Someone at a terminal can still pick a different size for that screen.\n\n70%\n150%\n100%\nSave\nWhatsApp Ordering\nLocked\nGenerate Key\nWhatsApp Ordering is not included in your current plan.\n\nGenerate a key here, then paste it into your WhatsApp ordering dashboard's Integrations → Jamanvaar screen. Once connected, this restaurant's real menu, prices and orders flow through your own POS and KDS — the WhatsApp side never invents a price or keeps its own menu.\n\nReport Branding & Legal Profile\n\nConfigure restaurant identity used on End of Day (EOD) Z-Reports, GST tax invoices, and thermal bills.\n\nSave Changes\nShow JAMAN AI Assistant\nDisplays the floating JAMAN AI button on POS, Captain and this Admin console. Turning this off hides it for every staff member at this restaurant.\nLIVE DOCUMENT HEADER PREVIEW:\nQA KIOSK ONLY MERGED ADMIN 1791270507575\n, ,\nGSTIN: • FSSAI:\nPhone: • Email:\n1. Restaurant Identity & Trade Names\nRestaurant Trade / Brand Name:\nUsed in customer apps, bills & headings\nLegal Registered Entity Name:\nUsed on GST Invoices & official EOD Reports\nBrand Tagline / Slogan:\nRestaurant Logo Asset Path / URL:\nReset\n2. Statutory Tax & Regulatory Credentials\nGSTIN Number (15 Digits):\nOptional — leave blank if not GST-registered\nFSSAI License Number (14 Digits):\nMSME / Udyam Number (Optional):\n3. Address & Geographical Location\nStreet Address:\nCity:\nState & Pincode:\n4. Contact Channels & Website\nContact Phone:\nContact Email:\nOfficial Website URL:\n5. Signatories & Printed Statement Footer\nRestaurant Owner Name:\nFloor Manager Name:\nReport Footer Closing Remark:\nSave & Apply Across All Reports\nCustomer Kiosk Language & Idle Timeout\n\nWhich languages the self-order kiosk offers, and how long it waits before resetting an idle session.\n\nEnglish\nहिन्दी (Hindi)\nગુજરાતી (Gujarati)\nमराठी (Marathi)\nதமிழ் (Tamil)\nతెలుగు (Telugu)\nಕನ್ನಡ (Kannada)\nDefault Language\nEnglish\nहिन्दी (Hindi)\nગુજરાતી (Gujarati)\nIdle Warning After (seconds)\nKiosk Order Token Counter\n\nThe kiosk hands out sequential tokens (K-101, K-102...) that reset automatically each new business day. Use this only to force an early restart mid-day.\n\nNEXT KIOSK TOKEN\n\nK-101\n\nReset to 101\nKiosk payment settings\nRefresh\n\nKiosk QR payments collect into Jamanvaar's account. Your net payable is transferred manually after your bank details are verified.\n\nOnline payments: NOT CONNECTED\n\nJamanvaar Fee: 3.00% on kiosk QR payments only. Super Admin controls this rate.\n\nCurrent collection account: Jamanvaar\n\nCurrent payout mode: Manual bank transfer\n\nRequest online payment activation\nRequest direct settlement to my bank\n\nRazorpay Route is pending. This toggle saves your request for later activation; payments continue through Jamanvaar with manual payouts. Save your bank details before enabling it.\n\nPayout bank: NOT_ADDED\nUpdate bank details\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE",
